1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,601
Something not working?

2
00:00:01,601 --> 00:00:04,900
Here are quick fixes for the most common problems.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:10,063
If your tablet can't connect, put both devices on the same Wi-Fi,

4
00:00:10,063 --> 00:00:13,015
check the PadDeck icon is in the PC's tray,

5
00:00:13,015 --> 00:00:16,379
click Allow through firewall on the Devices page,

6
00:00:16,379 --> 00:00:19,400
or type the address shown under the QR code.

7
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:23,724
If a button does nothing, check the badge says Connected,

8
00:00:23,724 --> 00:00:26,840
and read the message at the bottom of the screen.

9
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:29,002
Make sure you're not in Edit mode.

10
00:00:29,002 --> 00:00:34,280
Note that apps running as administrator ignore keyboard shortcuts from normal apps.

11
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:36,785
No sound from the soundboard?

12
00:00:36,785 --> 00:00:41,578
Check the output shown at the top of the soundboard, and turn off Focus mode.

13
00:00:41,578 --> 00:00:46,620
If the mic button doesn't mute, choose the right microphone in the Audio section.

14
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:52,252
If a tile says Unavailable, the app or file was moved or removed.

15
00:00:52,252 --> 00:00:58,170
Press Rescan on the Applications page, then edit the tile and choose it again.

